  "body_html": "<h1>Better Reply Secure Game</h1>\n<p>A game $G$ is better reply secure if for every Reny solution $(s,v)$, the profile\n$s$ is a Nash equilibrium.</p>\n<p>In this condition, Nash profiles and the strategy-profile components of Reny\nsolutions coincide.</p>",
